    "explanation": "To the rider: your route-deviation complaint is partly upheld and 2.21 SGD of your claim is refunded. The platform's recorded distances put the trip at 34.80 km against a recommended 32.40 km — a deviation of 2.40 km, more than double the 1.00 km tolerance — so the detour was real and out of tolerance (POL-RD-22). The driver accepts he did not tell you about it: the in-app chat carries only the two pick-up messages, both at 11:14, before the trip began at 11:16:14, the trip record's messages_during_trip and in_app_calls are empty, and a verbal notice with no recording cannot be established (POL-RD-21, POL-GEN-26). The deviation was therefore not 'agreed'. Your refund is the excess distance fare under POL-RD-24: 2.40 km x 0.92 SGD/km = 2.21 SGD, which is also the fare ledger's own excess_distance_fare_sgd figure. Your request for 30.00 SGD is more than this policy provides: the matrix pays the excess distance fare, not the whole trip fare, and the metered fare of 51.32 SGD was computed on the recorded 34.80 km and 40.0 minutes at the rate card. To the driver: the LTA advisory (LTA-TI-260929-3650, an accident on the AYE towards Tuas after the Lower Delta Road exit, valid 11:01-12:16) names the AYE in the direction of travel at a point on the stretch you bypassed and overlaps the trip window, so on its road, direction and location it intersects the recommended route and your reroute is traffic-justified under POL-RD-23. That places the case in POL-RD-24 row (b): traffic-justified, rider not informed, deviation over 1 km — a refund of the excess distance fare. While I read the traffic point your way rather than the rider's, nothing turns on it for the money, because row (d) (not traffic-justified, over 1 km) awards the identical 2.21 SGD. Because notice was not given, the same 2.21 SGD is payable either way. The fare was charged in full (total_charged 51.32 SGD, payment_status CHARGED) and refund_issued_sgd is 0.00. On decidability: the disputed value of 30.00 SGD sits in POL-GEN-22's 10.00-50.00 band, so the ruling stands at a confidence of 0.80 or more; no fraud flag applies to either profile, all artifacts relied on are complete at weight_multiplier 1.0 (so POL-GEN-02 caps nothing), and POL-RD-25's held 2.0 km limb is not applied (ai_ruling_max_deviation_applied is false). No referral clause of this category produces a referral, so none is made. All amounts above are read from the brief's money block (excess_distance_fare_sgd 2.21, per_km_rate_sgd 0.92, deviation_km 2.40, total_charged 51.32)."
  },
